---
// The cookie policy: the content file's body, then the core's cookie declaration, which the page template places below
// it (Konzilo's CookieDeclaration.astro), then the text design/content/README.md gives for after the declaration.
//
// The declaration is the Konzilo core's own: its markup and words are what cookieDeclarationMarkup() (src/consent/markup.js)
// writes for a registry that registryFile() (src/format/consent.js) makes from the core's facts, with the consent texts at
// the core's defaults (src/catalogues/en.json), for a site with no tag manager (tagManager.manager "None"), no departure
// and one embed service, YouTube, which the showpiece article embeds. So it lists the core's two services and nothing
// else: the consent's own storage, and YouTube, whose provider, purpose, host, transfers and empty storage are the core's
// (src/format/services.json) and which the core puts under Marketing, its provider advertising. Called as the public
// site's CookieDeclaration.astro calls it: level 2, records at /_konzilo/consent, which gives the Consent ID row, the legal
// pages at /privacy-policy/ and /cookie-policy/, and no host, so that an item on the page's host reads "This site". The
// declaration is shown as the core's client leaves it once it has run and found no choice (src/consent/client.js): the
// sentence for no script hidden, "no choice" shown, both buttons shown. konzilo.css draws it. It stands in a Reading Area
// whose menu side is empty, so that its column lines up with the policy's text above it.
import Site from '../src/layouts/Site.astro';
import Markdown from '../src/components/Markdown.astro';
import { postByFile } from '../src/lib/content.js';

const post = postByFile('pages/cookie-policy.md');
const address = post.address;

const declaration = `<div class="konzilo-declaration" data-konzilo-declaration data-konzilo-declaration-locale="en-GB"><section class="konzilo-declaration-consent" aria-labelledby="konzilo-declaration-consent"><h2 id="konzilo-declaration-consent">Your choice</h2><p class="konzilo-declaration-no-script" hidden>Your choice is shown here when JavaScript is turned on in your browser.</p><p class="konzilo-declaration-none">You have not made a choice yet, or your last one no longer applies.</p><dl class="konzilo-declaration-choice" hidden><dt>Consent ID</dt><dd><code data-konzilo-declaration-id></code></dd><dt>Made</dt><dd><time data-konzilo-declaration-time></time></dd><dt>Allows</dt><dd><ul><li data-konzilo-declaration-category="necessary">Necessary</li><li data-konzilo-declaration-category="marketing" hidden>Marketing</li><li data-konzilo-declaration-service="youtube" data-konzilo-declaration-in="marketing" hidden>YouTube</li></ul></dd></dl><div class="konzilo-consent-buttons"><button type="button" class="konzilo-consent-secondary" data-konzilo-consent-action="change">Change privacy settings</button><button type="button" class="konzilo-consent-secondary" data-konzilo-consent-action="withdraw">Withdraw consent</button></div></section><section class="konzilo-declaration-services" aria-labelledby="konzilo-declaration-services"><h2 id="konzilo-declaration-services">Services and what they store</h2><p class="konzilo-declaration-revised">The list was last changed on <time datetime="2026-11-12">12 November 2026</time>.</p><section class="konzilo-declaration-category" aria-labelledby="konzilo-declaration-category-necessary"><h3 id="konzilo-declaration-category-necessary">Necessary</h3><p>What the site needs to work and to remember your choice. Always on.</p><section class="konzilo-declaration-service" id="konzilo-declaration-service-consent" aria-labelledby="konzilo-declaration-service-consent-name"><h4 id="konzilo-declaration-service-consent-name">Consent</h4><dl><dt>Provider</dt><dd>This site. <a href="/privacy-policy/" data-konzilo-consent-policy="privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a></dd><dt>Purpose</dt><dd>Remembers which categories and services you allowed, and when, so that the site respects your choice.</dd><dt>Why it is needed</dt><dd>Without it the site could not keep to your choice, and would ask you on every page.</dd><dt>Addresses your browser contacts</dt><dd>None but this site&#39;s own</dd><dt>Transfers outside the EU and EEA</dt><dd>None</dd></dl><table><caption>What Consent stores in your browser</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">How long</th><th scope="col">Set by</th><th scope="col">Domain</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>konzilo-consent</code></td><td>local storage</td><td>12 months</td><td>This site</td><td><span data-konzilo-consent-host>This site</span></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section class="konzilo-declaration-category" aria-labelledby="konzilo-declaration-category-marketing"><h3 id="konzilo-declaration-category-marketing">Marketing</h3><p>Content and features from services whose providers may use what they learn about you for their own advertising or profiling.</p><section class="konzilo-declaration-service" id="konzilo-declaration-service-youtube" aria-labelledby="konzilo-declaration-service-youtube-name"><h4 id="konzilo-declaration-service-youtube-name">YouTube</h4><dl><dt>Provider</dt><dd>Google Ireland Limited, Ireland. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Ireland Limited&#39;s privacy policy</a></dd><dt>Purpose</dt><dd>Plays videos from YouTube in the page.</dd><dt>Addresses your browser contacts</dt><dd><ul><li><code>www.youtube-nocookie.com</code></li></ul></dd><dt>Transfers outside the EU and EEA</dt><dd><ul><li>United States, on the basis of an adequacy decision or standard contractual clauses</li></ul></dd></dl><p>Its provider lists nothing that it stores.</p></section></section></section></div>`
  + `<p>Your browser may also keep things the site does not ask it to, such as its cache. You can remove what a site has stored in your browser's settings; that also removes your choice, and the site will ask again. Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:privacy@ampfield.example">privacy@ampfield.example</a>.</p>`;
---
<Site title={post.data.title} address={address}>
  <Markdown file="pages/cookie-policy.md" title={post.data.title} address={address} />
  <section class="kn-band kn-section">
    <div class="kn-band-content">
      <div class="kn-section-body kn-body-text">
        <div class="kn-reading-area" data-kn-side="start" data-kn-stack="before">
          <div class="kn-reading-area-flow" set:html={declaration} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
